{"id":"4716","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4716_main_cirrus-fibratus-vertebratus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">毛卷云</span>的一个很好的例子，为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">脊状</span>云类，其元素类似于鱼的骨骼。没有看到凝结尾迹。地面风向东约5 kt。在卷云水平，按照西班牙加那利群岛特内里费岛最近的高空站估算，风向约为320°，速度为25 kt。1 030 hPa的反气旋以马德里附近为中心。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"西班牙加那利群岛兰萨罗特岛普拉亚布兰卡","latitude":"纬度: 28° 51' 37'' N","longitude":"经度: 13° 50' 45'' W","date":"09 November 2008 1217 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.10","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.10"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/4716_syn_cirrus-fibratus-vertebratus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>西部加那利群岛上空覆盖着东向东北的较弱表面气流，在马德里附近有一个1030 hPa的反气旋。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 德国气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/4716_upper_cirrus-fibratus-vertebratus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>在拍摄照片时(1200 UTC)，西班牙加那利群岛的特内里费岛吉马尔最近的下降显示出约620 hPa以下的非常干燥的空气。在440 hPa（6800米）和380 hPa（7800米）处可以看到浅湿层。后者是最可能出现卷云的高度。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4848_main_cirrus-vertebratus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>在法国东北部一个强大脊线的东南侧，在法国东南部上空展示了高层云（主要是卷云）。还有其他卷云形式（钩状云、絮状云、毛状云、辐辏状云），这里的例子是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">脊状</span>卷云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Peter Huszar","location":"法国马赛附近的卡西斯","latitude":"纬度: 43° 12' 46'' N","longitude":"经度: 5° 32' 14'' E","date":"20 June 2016 1100 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.10 1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.10 1"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4516_main_cirrus-fibratus-vertebratus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>主要的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云1</span>呈现鱼骨架形态，其中絮状团块（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>）构成脊柱，两侧排列的丝状体（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>）形成肋骨结构。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">6处</span>有一片独立的纤维状卷云。观测地点位于热带空气区，处于极地气团西缘的降水性暖锋南侧。</p></div>","copyright":"© P. Taft","location":"Albuquerque, New Mexico, United States of America","latitude":"纬度: 35° 5' 7'' N","longitude":"经度: 106° 36' 20'' W","date":"11 September 1950 1253 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}